Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,

Someone (hopefully you) asked to reset the password for <%= @user.email_address %>.

Choose a new password here:
<%= edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>

The link works for <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>. If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email: your password stays the same.